Description: Wild OS App Bridge for Windows programs
 Opens Windows programs and installers. Recognises common ones and points
 to their Wild OS versions in the Store, explains the few that can't run,
 and installs the rest in Windows mode, where each opens in a window of
 its own with a Start entry.
